`s 58(6)(a) — the aggregate for the flat rate benefits and the base portions` `the flat rate benefit payable under subparagraph (1)(a)(i) or (a.1)(i)` `the flat rate benefit payable under paragraph 56(1)(a)` `the contributor's retirement pension portions under subsections 58(3), (3.1) and (3.4)` `the retirement pension portions of the disability pension under subsections 56(3), (3.1) and (3.2)` `the benefit of 25% of 1/12 of the survivor's Maximum Pensionable Earnings Average, adjusted` MEANS
    (max `the flat rate benefit payable under subparagraph (1)(a)(i) or (a.1)(i)` `the flat rate benefit payable under paragraph 56(1)(a)`)
