                -- and (C), (2) the amount under paragraph 56(1)(b) without subparagraphs (ii) and (iii).
                (`cp4 the greater of two amounts plus 60% of the lesser` (37.5% TIMES `the contributor's retirement pension portions under subsections 58(3), (3.1) and (3.4)`'s `cp4 the base portion of a retirement pension`) (75% TIMES `the retirement pension portions of the disability pension under subsections 56(3), (3.1) and (3.2)`'s `cp4 the base portion of a retirement pension`))
                -- (B): 75% of the benefit of 25% of 1/12 of the survivor's Maximum Pensionable Earnings Average.
                (75% TIMES `the benefit of 25% of 1/12 of the survivor's Maximum Pensionable Earnings Average, adjusted`))

